=== D-CASFCH: GET/PUT/FIELD/INPUT$ on a CAS: channel, MEASURED ===

program (identical on both sides):
    5 MAXFILES=3
    10 ONERRORGOTO900
    79 E=0:OPEN"CAS:D"FOR INPUT AS#3:POKE&HD010,E
    81 E=0:FIELD#3,10 AS C$:POKE&HD011,E
    82 E=0:GET#3,1:POKE&HD012,E
    83 E=0:PUT#3,1:POKE&HD013,E
    84 E=0:A$=INPUT$(1,#3):POKE&HD014,E
    86 POKE&HD015,&HA5
    88 END
    900 E=ERR:RESUME NEXT

-- zerobas: AUTOEXEC.BAS from disk + $EA tape, RAM read back --

-- CF-3300: AUTOEXEC.BAS from disk + $EA tape, RAM read back --

  slot     statement                      CF-3300   zerobas
  open     OPEN"CAS:T"FOR OUTPUT AS#1         255       255
  field    FIELD#1,10 AS A$                   255       255
  get      GET#1,1                            255       255
  put      PUT#1,1                            255       255
  inp      A$=INPUT$(1,#1)                    255       255
  MARK     -- cas done marker &HA5 --         255       255  🔴 DID NOT REACH IT
  l.open   OPEN"LPT:"FOR OUTPUT AS#2          255       255
  l.field  FIELD#2,10 AS B$                   255       255
  l.get    GET#2,1                            255       255
  l.inp    A$=INPUT$(1,#2)                    255       255
  LMARK    -- lpt done marker &HA5 --         255       255  🔴 DID NOT REACH IT
  i.open   OPEN"CAS:D"FOR INPUT AS#3   (CAS_IN_MODE 8)         0         0
  i.field  FIELD#3,10 AS C$                     5         5
  i.get    GET#3,1                             58        58
  i.put    PUT#3,1                             58        58
  i.inp    A$=INPUT$(1,#3)                      0        55  🔴 DIFF
  IMARK    -- cas-input done marker &HA5 --       165       165

